{"uid":"4b9e46aa36cb8bab","name":"test_the_generated_cookbook_nav_and_pagers_are_in_lab_number_order","fullName":"tests.test_cookbook_doc_contract#test_the_generated_cookbook_nav_and_pagers_are_in_lab_number_order","historyId":"71357e448e276b01644b624911d19152","time":{"start":1793164383393,"stop":1793164383397,"duration":4},"description":"The nav manifest and each detail page's prev/next pager follow lab number, not edit order.\n\n    ``training/content.py``'s ``COOKBOOKS`` list literal is ordered by whenever each entry was\n    last touched (labs 05, 16 and 18 have historically landed out of sequence); every consumer\n    in ``training/build.py`` walks that list positionally, so an edit-order regression there is\n    directly visible as a scrambled cookbook list in the docs toolbar and wrong Next/Previous\n    links on the cookbook pages themselves. This pins the *output*, so it fails regardless of\n    which end (the source list or its consumers) drifts.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The nav manifest and each detail page's prev/next pager follow lab number, not edit order.</p>\n<pre><code>``training/content.py``'s ``COOKBOOKS`` list literal is ordered by whenever each entry was\nlast touched (labs 05, 16 and 18 have historically landed out of sequence); every consumer\nin ``training/build.py`` walks that list positionally, so an edit-order regression there is\ndirectly visible as a scrambled cookbook list in the docs toolbar and wrong Next/Previous\nlinks on the cookbook pages themselves. This pins the *output*, so it fails regardless of\nwhich end (the source list or its consumers) drifts.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1793163922649,"stop":1793163922649,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCoun